  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b>&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;</b>의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 <b><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">'협업'</span></b>을 위해<b> 공유</b>되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68); line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</u></span></b></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px dashed rgb(121, 165, 228); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251);\"><p><b style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">#광물 #조암광물 #광물의특성 #구글클래스룸 #구글문서</span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p>안녕하세요 과학쌤^^</p><p>광물에 대한 영상과 활동지를 공유해봅니다.</p><p><br></p><p>조암광물</p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><font face=\"Arial\">[학습과제] 주위의 암석을 촬영하여 구성 광물 추측해보기</font></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><font face=\"Arial\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PYDKcRjWcKc8cv-QiTiBUxPq5oCu7PGQ/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PYDKcRjWcKc8cv-QiTiBUxPq5oCu7PGQ/view?usp=sharing</a></font></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></span></p><p><iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CBBWMOVCHnc\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p>광물의 특성</p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><font face=\"Arial\">[학습과제] 광물의 특성 비쥬얼씽킹</font></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: in